      "sample_index": 1,
      "text": "To determine how many minutes it will take to print 200 pages with a printer that prints 17 pages per minute, we can use the following steps:\n\n1. Identify the rate at which the printer works. The printer prints 17 pages per minute.\n2. Determine the total number of pages to be printed. This is given as 200 pages.\n3. Calculate the time required by dividing the total number of pages by the printing rate.\n\nThe calculation is as follows:\n\\[\n\\text{Time} = \\frac{\\text{Total pages}}{\\text{Pages per minute}} = \\frac{200 \\text{ pages}}{17 \\text{ pages per minute}}\n\\]\n\nPerform the division:\n\\[\n\\frac{200}{17} \\approx 11.7647\n\\]\n\nSince we need the time to the nearest whole number, we round 11.7647 to the nearest whole number, which is 12.\n\nTherefore, the time required to print 200 pages is \\boxed{12}.",
